        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Lowe\n- Products: Space Ghost Coast to Coast\n- Organizations: Hanna-Barbera\n- Concepts: voice acting, comedy, reboots, adult animation, surreal spoof talk shows\n\nFacts:\n- George Lowe was born on November 10, 1958.\n- George Lowe is an American voice actor and comedian.\n- The original 1960s Space Ghost series aired as a standard Hanna-Barbera Saturday-morning superhero cartoon.\n- Space Ghost Coast to Coast was a total reboot of the original Space Ghost series intended for adults.\n- Space Ghost Coast to Coast reinterpreted the series as a surreal spoof talk show.\n- Space Ghost Coast to Coast was produced using the original artwork.",
